<titlePage type="main"><docTitle><titlePart type="main"><hi rendition="#b">Das<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Deut&#x017F;che Gaunerthum</hi></hi></titlePart><lb/>
<titlePart type="sub">in<lb/>
&#x017F;einer &#x017F;ocial-politi&#x017F;chen, literari&#x017F;chen und lingui&#x017F;ti&#x017F;chen Ausbildung<lb/>
zu &#x017F;einem heutigen Be&#x017F;tande.</titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<byline>Von<lb/>
<docAuthor><hi rendition="#fr">Friedrich Chri&#x017F;tian Benedict Avé-Lallemant,</hi></docAuthor><lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Doctor beider Rechte.</hi></byline><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
